Manage app connections

Usage: vendo apps [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List all app connections
  diagnose  Show app connections that need attention
  get       Get app details
  pause     Pause an app connection
  resume    Resume a paused app connection
  delete    Delete an app connection (soft delete)
  create    Create a new app connection
  update    Update an app connection
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help
